<title>USA: McKinney ISD, Texas won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>McKinney ISD, Texas won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $15.85 million of McKinney Independent Sch Dist, Texas, general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.456 percent.</p>
</text>
